				<h2>Landlords</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="probate-intro">
        	<p class="leasing-tips__lead">    
				<p>Entering into a commercial or retail lease involves important legal and financial considerations. 
                   At Cleverminds Legal Centre, we assist landlords in understanding their obligations, protecting their 
                   interests and avoiding costly leasing disputes.</p>
                <br>
                <p> </p>
                   <p>
                   &nbsp;
                   </p>
			</div>
            
			<div class="instruments">
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">01</span>
					<h3>Understand Your Legal Obligations:</h3>
					<p>Ensure you comply with the NSW Retail Leases Act 1994 and other applicable leasing requirements before entering into a lease.</p>
                    </a>
				</article>
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">02</span>
					<h3>Document Agreed Lease Terms:</h3>
					<p>Prepare clear Heads of Agreement outlining the key commercial terms before drafting the formal lease.</p>
					<!--- <a class="instrument__link" href="/legal-services/power-of-attorney">Commercial Property Sales</a> --->
				</article>
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">03</span>
					<h3>Provide Required Disclosure Documents:</h3>
					<p>Ensure prospective tenants receive the required lease documents and disclosure statements within the prescribed timeframes.</p>
					<!--- <a class="instrument__link" href="/legal-services/enduring-guardian">Retirement Village Sales</a> --->
				</article>
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">04</span>
					<h3>Prepare Accurate Disclosure Statements:</h3>
					<p>Provide complete and accurate information about the premises, rent, outgoings and other relevant leasing conditions.</p>
					<!---  <a class="instrument__link" href="/legal-services/enduring-guardian">Vacant Land Sales</a> --->
				</article>
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">05</span>
					<h3>Verify the Tenant's Financial Position:</h3>
					<p>Assess the prospective tenant's financial capacity, business experience and ability to meet their lease obligations.</p>
					<!---  <a class="instrument__link" href="/legal-services/enduring-guardian">Rural Land Sales</a> --->
				</article>
				<article class="instrument">
					<span class="instrument__num">06</span>
					<h3>Obtain Appropriate Financial Security:</h3>
					<p>Consider bank guarantees, security deposits and personal guarantees to protect against potential tenant defaults.</p>
					<!---  <a class="instrument__link" href="/legal-services/enduring-guardian">Put & Call Options</a> --->
				</article>
